OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFailure to modernise surgical
OL,4,Aservices risks making things worse -
OL,5,Asurgeons speak out
OL,6,
OL,7,FA letter, signed by surgeons from
OL,8,Facross the UK and Ireland, said they
OL,9,Ffelt they had no option but to
OL,10,Fintervene when it appeared politics not
OL,11,Fpatient safety was influencing
OL,12,Fdiscussions around EGS provision.
OL,14,FMark Cheetam, who carried out a review
OL,15,Finto the Northern Health Trust EGS in
OL,16,F2024, said that without reform,
OL,17,F"there's a real danger of an unplanned
OL,18,Fservice collapse".
